                                           &lt;p&gt;a) Select the Start button, t=
hen select Settings &gt;=0A                                                   =
 Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A                       =
                             scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                               =
                 &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers, then choose the=
=0A                                                    one you want to use,=
 and select Add device. If you want=0A                                     =
               to remove the printer later, just highlight it and=0A       =
                                             select Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Se=
tup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                                         =
       &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    1.Pre=
pare your printer:=0A                                                &lt;/stro=
ng&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;Use the instruc=
tions that came with your printer to=0A                                    =
