                                                    Turn on the printer and=
 make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A                                  =
                  any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                    =
            &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    =
2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A                   =
                                 came with the printer to connect it to the=
 network.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=
                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A                     =
                               If you have a Wi-Fi printer, you might need =
to connect=0A                                                    the printe=
r to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A                          =
                          printing. After connecting the printer to your Ma=
c,=0A                                                    install the Mac so=
ftware that came with the printer and=0A                                   =
                 use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant to connect the p=
rinter=0A                                                    to your Wi-Fi =
network. After setting up, you can=0A                                      =
              disconnect the cable from your printer and Mac and the=0A    =
                                                printer should remain conne=
cted to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                                              =
  &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A    =
                                                3. Add the printer to your =
list of available printers:=0A                                             =
   &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A   =
